2️⃣2️⃣ Important Interview Point

Each BERT-Base encoder block contains:

Component	Count
Linear layers in attention	4
Linear layers in FFN	2
LayerNorm	2
Residual connections	2
Dropout layers	2

Total layers in BERT-Base:

12 encoder blocks
